"Reply HELP for help. You can also contact XTimers support at %1$@xintechllc.com/XTimers/support.html%2$@." = "Balas HELP untuk bantuan. Anda juga dapat menghubungi dukungan XTimers di %1$@xintechllc.com/XTimers/support.html%2$@.";
"Reply STOP to opt out of SMS messages from XTimers. After you send STOP,\n      XTimers will stop sending SMS messages to that phone number\n      unless you opt in again." = "Balas STOP untuk berhenti menerima pesan SMS dari XTimers. Setelah Anda mengirim STOP, XTimers akan berhenti mengirim pesan SMS ke nomor telepon tersebut kecuali Anda mendaftar lagi.";
