"Retention and Deletion" = "Penyimpanan dan Penghapusan";
"Review snapshots, add notes, and send reports to your account email." = "Tinjau cuplikan, tambahkan catatan, dan kirim laporan ke email akun Anda.";
"Rings On" = "Berdering di";
"Run timers, alarms, reports, reminders, messaging, custom sounds, and sharing." = "Jalankan timer, alarm, laporan, pengingat, pesan, suara kustom, dan berbagi.";
